andomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nDuring the war, the Red Army captures a member of the Blue Army. They want him to tell them where the Blue Army's tank is, they know the tank is either by the sea or in the mountains. They know the prisoner does not want to tell them, he wants to save his own army, so he definitely lies to them. The prisoner is brave and smart, he does not let them find his tank. Now when they ask him where the tank is, he says: \"In the mountains.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhere does the Red Army go to find his tank?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. In the mountains\nB. At the sea","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609410637155941,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af593759aa9dc5a833d7bc6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794478965216,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:22:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5c40117d8f5a4503a2bc9370d67b50f3"}